   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位前輩們好，小弟在近日想要以R 套件 gtrendsR抓取Google Trends相關資料時<div>發生疑似下列BUG</div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ImRu6d4Ni2A/Ws65Pj9QAdI/AAAAAAAAAQY/AvxR94An26YULyWXFNdWmUsK04o_pgBzACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ImRu6d4Ni2A/Ws65Pj9QAdI/AAAAAAAAAQY/AvxR94An26YULyWXFNdWmUsK04o_pgBzACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR1.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237472080000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bRyVYXLLmCmTW5T4tLqU8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ImRu6d4Ni2A/Ws65Pj9QAdI/AAAAAAAAAQY/AvxR94An26YULyWXFNdWmUsK04o_pgBzACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR1.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"clear:both\">Error in make.names(col.names, unique = TRUE) : </p><p style=\"clear:both\">  invalid multibyte string at &#39;&lt;e6&gt;&lt;9c&gt;&lt;88&gt;&lt;2c&gt;</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">將錯誤訊息餵入GOOGLE後，發現在許多讀取CSV案例中有類似問題，因此認定為編碼問題，但由於讀取CSV方法有encoding方法可以指定編碼</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">在gtrends中則沒有，於是小弟指定全域後</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dNmZjIBitK8/Ws66TkmSr8I/AAAAAAAAAQk/lLwyL-wQw0gxjJCZbEGufbANL-ge4tBPQCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR4.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dNmZjIBitK8/Ws66TkmSr8I/AAAAAAAAAQk/lLwyL-wQw0gxjJCZbEGufbANL-ge4tBPQCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR4.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237472081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3w7M6W9wxE9G6DoCz8renk\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dNmZjIBitK8/Ws66TkmSr8I/AAAAAAAAAQk/lLwyL-wQw0gxjJCZbEGufbANL-ge4tBPQCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR4.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">還是一樣問題，於是又一不做二不休，把語系整個...</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bae_C56Cqro/Ws66nqrhGnI/AAAAAAAAAQw/4C7JkxrBMfEqfV01BZSh0Fax4fc9JyC2ACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR2.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bae_C56Cqro/Ws66nqrhGnI/AAAAAAAAAQw/4C7JkxrBMfEqfV01BZSh0Fax4fc9JyC2ACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR2.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237472081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MlkATo6UNuRYy9PWMhC3U\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bae_C56Cqro/Ws66nqrhGnI/AAAAAAAAAQw/4C7JkxrBMfEqfV01BZSh0Fax4fc9JyC2ACLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR2.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>終於抓到了，但中文編碼也整個爆掉了</div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bmhgDXUITDc/Ws66-L8uAdI/AAAAAAAAAQ8/nVXKJqa_fzAQZCe9vYB_zSE2rWwRmWuPgCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR3.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bmhgDXUITDc/Ws66-L8uAdI/AAAAAAAAAQ8/nVXKJqa_fzAQZCe9vYB_zSE2rWwRmWuPgCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR3.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237472081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aftlQOQWboDmRK9jagr3Z\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-bmhgDXUITDc/Ws66-L8uAdI/AAAAAAAAAQ8/nVXKJqa_fzAQZCe9vYB_zSE2rWwRmWuPgCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR3.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">想請教各位大大，是否有方法能解決在中文語系下使用 gtrendsR 疑似編碼的問題?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">有爬過英文網站，但爬到的有一半都是CSV，實在不知道要如何解決，麻煩各位前輩了，感謝!!!!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">已下放上原始碼</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">library(gtrendsR)<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">google.trends = gtrends(&quot;鴻海&quot;,geo = &quot;TW&quot;,gprop = &quot;web&quot;, time = &quot;all&quot;)[[1]]<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">#options(encoding = &quot;UTF-8&quot;)<br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div>#Sys.setlocale(&quot;LC_ALL&quot;, &quot;English&quot;)</div><div>#Sys.setlocale(&quot;LC_ALL&quot;,&quot;cht&quot;)<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>以下是<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif\">sessionInfo</span></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9G3LB9JMaFo/Ws69Hp3nFrI/AAAAAAAAARU/pc1vHkr9tgQ-nLF9-ZUGnjv9JKF5K-cjwCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR5.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9G3LB9JMaFo/Ws69Hp3nFrI/AAAAAAAAARU/pc1vHkr9tgQ-nLF9-ZUGnjv9JKF5K-cjwCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR5.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237472081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3q-HUVsjVt0gXcC5tEwWEc\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-9G3LB9JMaFo/Ws69Hp3nFrI/AAAAAAAAARU/pc1vHkr9tgQ-nLF9-ZUGnjv9JKF5K-cjwCLcBGAs/s1600/GtrendsR5.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif\"><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
